{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-kawantumbuh01",
    "name": "KAWANTUMBUH API",
    "description": "Collection untuk menguji endpoint Auth, Users, dan Children pada KAWANTUMBUH API.\n\nUrutan test yang disarankan:\n1. Auth > Register (menyimpan userId, accessToken, refreshToken)\n2. Auth > Login\n3. Auth > Me / Sessions\n4. Children > Create (menyimpan childId) lalu List/Get/Update/Delete\n5. Auth > Refresh, Logout, Logout All\n6. Auth > Forgot Password -> Verify Reset Code -> Reset Password\n\nSemua request butuh header Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}} kecuali Register, Login, Refresh, Logout, Social Login, Forgot Password, Verify Reset Code, dan Reset Password.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "System",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "API Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": [""] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('nama API benar', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().name).to.eql('KAWANTUMBUH API'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
